# Personal Learning Repository

This repository contains my personal practice projects, code experiments, and learning exercises.  
It is used only for skill development, exploring new technologies, and experimenting with different programming concepts.

## Purpose
- Improve coding skills
- Practice version control with Git and GitHub
- Build small demos, prototypes, and test projects
- Learn new tools, frameworks, and programming languages

## Notes
- This repository does **not** contain any organization or client-related code.
- All work here is purely for personal learning and experimentation.

## Technologies Used
- Add languages or tools you plan to use (e.g. Python, JavaScript, HTML/CSS, etc.)

## How to Use
1. Explore the folders for different practice exercises.
2. Each folder may contain its own README or explanation.
3. Feel free to use or modify the code for learning purposes.

